## Sister project

JK BMS Modbus monitor lives in `jk-pb-rs485-monitor` (115200 / slave 15 / UART1). Pylon-style BMS bench slave: `jk-pb-rs485-monitor/emulator/bms-pylon-emu.py`. Do not merge full Deye + JK IRIV job sets onto one gateway without trimming under 26 jobs and using separate RS485 buses.
